```

`IsSupported` reads `tga.image_type`, `tga.width`, `tga.height`, `tga.pixel_size`, etc. If any of these are uninitialized, MSAN would flag it.

So the vulnerability might be triggered by a very short input that causes `s >> tga` to not read all fields, leaving some uninitialized, and then `IsSupported` reads them.

